OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy with outbreaks of rain.
OL,6,FThe rain will become heavy in the east
OL,7,Ffrom the early afternoon but will
OL,8,Fclear in the west and the far south
OL,9,Ftowards the evening.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FOutbreaks of rain, heavy in
OL,12,Fthe east at first but dry in the west.
OL,13,FThe rain will clear east by midnight ,
OL,14,Fleaving dry conditions and increasing
OL,15,Fclear spells.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSaturday:FDry with bright spells at
OL,18,Ffirst otherwise outbreaks of rain,
OL,19,Fheavy at times, soon spread east.
OL,20,FBecoming drier towards evening. Windy
OL,21,Ffor a time.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
