OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FVery
OL,6,Fwindy with severe gales and locally
OL,7,Fheavy showers Sunday. Dry and bright
OL,8,Fmorning Monday, becoming windy with
OL,9,Frain later. Windy with showers Tuesday.
